// 关闭网页功能：用于发布管理 → 网页填表 → 关闭网页。会自动接受“离开此网站”弹窗并关闭所有已打开的发布页。
"use strict";

const http = require("http");
const net = require("net");
const crypto = require("crypto");

function parseTargetIdFromWsUrl(wsUrl) {
  try {
    const u = new URL(String(wsUrl || "").trim());
    const path = String(u.pathname || "");
    const parts = path.split("/").filter(Boolean);
    const last = parts[parts.length - 1] || "";
    return String(last || "").trim();
  } catch {
    return "";
  }
}

function httpGetRaw(url, timeoutMs = 2500) {
  return new Promise((resolve) => {
    try {
      const u = new URL(String(url || "").trim());
      const req = http.request(
        {
          protocol: u.protocol,
          hostname: u.hostname,
          port: Number(u.port || 80) || 80,
          path: (u.pathname || "/") + (u.search || ""),
          method: "GET",
          headers: { "User-Agent": "ipfactory" }
        },
        (res) => {
          const chunks = [];
          res.on("data", (d) => chunks.push(Buffer.isBuffer(d) ? d : Buffer.from(String(d))));
          res.on("end", () => {
            const buf = Buffer.concat(chunks);
            resolve({ ok: true, statusCode: Number(res.statusCode || 0) || 0, raw: buf.toString("utf-8") });
          });
        }
      );
      req.on("error", () => resolve({ ok: false, statusCode: 0, raw: "" }));
      req.setTimeout(Math.max(200, Number(timeoutMs || 0) || 2500), () => {
        try {
          req.destroy();
        } catch {}
        resolve({ ok: false, statusCode: 0, raw: "" });
      });
      req.end();
    } catch {
      resolve({ ok: false, statusCode: 0, raw: "" });
    }
  });
}

function parseWsUrl(wsUrl) {
  const u = new URL(String(wsUrl || ""));
  const host = u.hostname || "127.0.0.1";
  const port = Number(u.port || 80) || 80;
  const pathAndQuery = (u.pathname || "/") + (u.search || "");
  return { host, port, pathAndQuery };
}

function wsConnect(wsUrl, timeoutMs = 8000) {
  return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {
    let settled = false;
    const { host, port, pathAndQuery } = parseWsUrl(wsUrl);
    const socket = net.createConnection({ host, port });
    const key = crypto.randomBytes(16).toString("base64");
    let headerBuf = Buffer.alloc(0);
    let handshakeDone = false;
    let dataBuf = Buffer.alloc(0);
    const onMessageCbs = new Set();
    const pendingSend = [];

    const cleanup = () => {
      try { socket.removeAllListeners(); } catch {}
    };
    const fail = (err) => {
      if (settled) return;
      settled = true;
      cleanup();
      try { socket.destroy(); } catch {}
      reject(err instanceof Error ? err : new Error(String(err || "ws connect error")));
    };

    const sendFrame = (payloadBuf) => {
      const payloadLen = payloadBuf.length;
      const maskKey = crypto.randomBytes(4);
      const masked = Buffer.alloc(payloadLen);
      for (let i = 0; i < payloadLen; i += 1) masked[i] = payloadBuf[i] ^ maskKey[i % 4];
      let header = null;
      if (payloadLen < 126) {
        header = Buffer.alloc(2);
        header[0] = 0x81;
        header[1] = 0x80 | payloadLen;
      } else if (payloadLen < 65536) {
        header = Buffer.alloc(4);
        header[0] = 0x81;
        header[1] = 0x80 | 126;
        header.writeUInt16BE(payloadLen, 2);
      } else {
        header = Buffer.alloc(10);
        header[0] = 0x81;
        header[1] = 0x80 | 127;
        header.writeBigUInt64BE(BigInt(payloadLen), 2);
      }
      const frame = Buffer.concat([header, maskKey, masked]);
      socket.write(frame);
    };

    const tryFlush = () => {
      while (pendingSend.length) {
        const buf = pendingSend.shift();
        sendFrame(buf);
      }
    };

    const decodeFrames = () => {
      while (dataBuf.length >= 2) {
        const b0 = dataBuf[0];
        const b1 = dataBuf[1];
        const fin = (b0 & 0x80) !== 0;
        const opcode = b0 & 0x0f;
        const masked = (b1 & 0x80) !== 0;
        let len = b1 & 0x7f;
        let off = 2;
        if (len === 126) {
          if (dataBuf.length < off + 2) return;
          len = dataBuf.readUInt16BE(off);
          off += 2;
        } else if (len === 127) {
          if (dataBuf.length < off + 8) return;
          len = Number(dataBuf.readBigUInt64BE(off));
          off += 8;
        }
        const maskOff = masked ? 4 : 0;
        if (dataBuf.length < off + maskOff + len) return;
        let payload = dataBuf.subarray(off + maskOff, off + maskOff + len);
        if (masked) {
          const mk = dataBuf.subarray(off, off + 4);
          const un = Buffer.alloc(len);
          for (let i = 0; i < len; i += 1) un[i] = payload[i] ^ mk[i % 4];
          payload = un;
        }
        dataBuf = dataBuf.subarray(off + maskOff + len);
        if (opcode === 0x8) {
          try { socket.end(); } catch {}
          return;
        }
        if (opcode === 0x9) {
          const pong = Buffer.from([0x8a, payload.length]);
          socket.write(Buffer.concat([pong, payload]));
          continue;
        }
        if (opcode !== 0x1) continue;
        if (!fin) continue;
        const text = payload.toString("utf-8");
        onMessageCbs.forEach((cb) => {
          try { cb(text); } catch {}
        });
      }
    };

    const timer = setTimeout(() => fail(new Error("ws connect timeout")), Math.max(200, Number(timeoutMs || 0) || 8000));

    socket.on("connect", () => {
      const req =
        `GET ${pathAndQuery} HTTP/1.1\r\n` +
        `Host: ${host}:${port}\r\n` +
        "Upgrade: websocket\r\n" +
        "Connection: Upgrade\r\n" +
        `Sec-WebSocket-Key: ${key}\r\n` +
        "Sec-WebSocket-Version: 13\r\n" +
        "\r\n";
      socket.write(req);
    });
    socket.on("error", fail);
    socket.on("close", () => {
      if (!settled && !handshakeDone) fail(new Error("ws closed"));
    });
    socket.on("data", (chunk) => {
      if (!handshakeDone) {
        headerBuf = Buffer.concat([headerBuf, chunk]);
        const idx = headerBuf.indexOf("\r\n\r\n");
        if (idx === -1) return;
        const head = headerBuf.subarray(0, idx + 4).toString("utf-8");
        const rest = headerBuf.subarray(idx + 4);
        if (!/^HTTP\/1\.1 101/i.test(head)) return fail(new Error("ws handshake failed"));
        handshakeDone = true;
        clearTimeout(timer);
        dataBuf = Buffer.concat([dataBuf, rest]);
        decodeFrames();
        tryFlush();
        if (!settled) {
          settled = true;
          resolve({
            sendText: (text) => {
              const buf = Buffer.from(String(text || ""), "utf-8");
              if (!handshakeDone) pendingSend.push(buf);
              else sendFrame(buf);
            },
            onMessage: (cb) => {
              if (typeof cb !== "function") return () => {};
              onMessageCbs.add(cb);
              return () => onMessageCbs.delete(cb);
            },
            close: () => {
              try { socket.end(Buffer.from([0x88, 0x00])); } catch {}
            }
          });
        }
        return;
      }
      dataBuf = Buffer.concat([dataBuf, chunk]);
      decodeFrames();
    });
  });
}

async function createCdp(wsUrl) {
  const ws = await wsConnect(wsUrl, 8000);
  let idSeq = 1;
  const waits = new Map();
  const eventListeners = new Map();
  const off = ws.onMessage((text) => {
    try {
      const msg = JSON.parse(String(text || "{}"));
      const id = Number(msg?.id || 0) || 0;
      if (id && waits.has(id)) {
        const { resolve, reject } = waits.get(id);
        waits.delete(id);
        if (msg?.error) reject(new Error(String(msg?.error?.message || "cdp error")));
        else resolve(msg?.result);
        return;
      }
      const method = String(msg?.method || "").trim();
      if (!method) return;
      const params = msg?.params;
      const set = eventListeners.get(method);
      if (set && set.size) {
        set.forEach((cb) => {
          try { cb(params); } catch {}
        });
      }
    } catch {}
  });
  const send = (method, params) =>
    new Promise((resolve, reject) => {
      const id = idSeq++;
      waits.set(id, { resolve, reject });
      ws.sendText(JSON.stringify({ id, method, params: params || {} }));
    });
  const onEvent = (method, cb) => {
    const m = String(method || "").trim();
    if (!m || typeof cb !== "function") return () => {};
    const set = eventListeners.get(m) || new Set();
    set.add(cb);
    eventListeners.set(m, set);
    return () => {
      try {
        const s = eventListeners.get(m);
        if (s) s.delete(cb);
      } catch {}
    };
  };
  const close = () => {
    try {
      eventListeners.clear();
      off();
    } catch {}
    try { ws.close(); } catch {}
  };
  return { send, onEvent, close };
}

async function closeAllExternalWebPages(sessions) {
  const list = Array.isArray(sessions) ? sessions : [];
  let closed = 0;
  const failed = [];
  for (const s of list) {
    const port = Number(s?.port || 0) || 0;
    const wsUrl = String(s?.wsUrl || "").trim();
    const sessionId = String(s?.sessionId || "").trim();
    const targetId = parseTargetIdFromWsUrl(wsUrl);
    if (!port || !targetId) {
      failed.push({ sessionId, port, wsUrl, targetId, reason: "invalid_session" });
      continue;
    }
    let acceptedDialog = false;
    try {
      if (wsUrl) {
        const cdp = await createCdp(wsUrl);
        try {
          await cdp.send("Page.enable").catch(() => null);
          const offDlg = cdp.onEvent("Page.javascriptDialogOpening", async () => {
            acceptedDialog = true;
            try { await cdp.send("Page.handleJavaScriptDialog", { accept: true }); } catch {}
          });
          await cdp.send("Runtime.enable").catch(() => null);
          await cdp
            .send("Runtime.evaluate", { expression: "try{window.onbeforeunload=null;}catch(e){};true", awaitPromise: true, returnByValue: true })
            .catch(() => null);
          await cdp.send("Page.close").catch(() => null);
          await new Promise((r) => setTimeout(r, 420));
          try { offDlg(); } catch {}
        } finally {
          try { cdp.close(); } catch {}
        }
      }
    } catch {}
    const closeUrl = `http://127.0.0.1:${port}/json/close/${encodeURIComponent(targetId)}`;
    const r = await httpGetRaw(closeUrl, 2500);
    if (r?.ok && r.statusCode >= 200 && r.statusCode < 400) closed += 1;
    else failed.push({ sessionId, port, wsUrl, targetId, reason: "close_failed", acceptedDialog, statusCode: r?.statusCode || 0 });
  }
  return { ok: true, closed, failed };
}

module.exports = {
  closeAllExternalWebPages
};
